x-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> as a type I <em>plane</em> region in the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"99\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-plane with the upper curve</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"100\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-a6a28baab47449eec9d7748efdd9a8ba\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/a6a28baab47449eec9d7748efdd9a8ba\"></div>\n\n<p>Hence, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"101\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mrow space=\"4\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.222em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.222em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2264\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2264\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.222em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2264\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2264\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>:</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">}</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, we write the triple integral as follows:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"102\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 17.434em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222D TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em; padding-left: 0.431em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-under></mjx-row></mjx-munder><mjx-msup space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"